{"text":"kuruntokai","n":166,"lines":["தண்கடற் படுதிரை பெயர்த்தலின் வெண்பறை","நாரை நிரைபெயர்ந் தயிரை யாரும்","ஊரோ நன்றுமன் மரந்தை","ஒருதனி வைகிற் புலம்பா கின்றே"],"tr":["taṇkaṭaṟ paṭutirai peyarttaliṉ veṇpaṟai","nārai niraipeyarn tayirai yārum","ūrō naṉṟumaṉ marantai","orutaṉi vaikiṟ pulampā kiṉṟē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"neytal","tinai_ta":"நெய்தல்","speaker_ta":"தோழி கூற்று","poet_ta":"கூடலூர் கிழார்","speaker_en":"her friend (tōḻi)","poet_tr":"Kūṭalūr Kiḻār"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"4 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"3×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 15"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 8, veṇṭaḷai 6"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"தண்கடற்","tr":"taṇkaṭaṟ","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தண்","tr":"taṇ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"கடற்","tr":"kaṭaṟ"}]},{"text":"படுதிரை","tr":"paṭutirai","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"படு","tr":"paṭu"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"திரை","tr":"tirai"}]},{"text":"பெயர்த்தலின்","tr":"peyarttaliṉ","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பெயர்த்","tr":"peyart"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"தலின்","tr":"taliṉ"}]},{"text":"வெண்பறை","tr":"veṇpaṟai","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வெண்","tr":"veṇ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"பறை","tr":"paṟai"}]}],[{"text":"நாரை","tr":"nārai","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நா","tr":"nā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரை","tr":"rai"}]},{"text":"நிரைபெயர்ந்","tr":"niraipeyarn","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"நிரை","tr":"nirai"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"பெயர்ந்","tr":"peyarn"}]},{"text":"தயிரை","tr":"tayirai","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"தயி","tr":"tayi"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரை","tr":"rai"}]},{"text":"யாரும்","tr":"yārum","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யா","tr":"yā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரும்","tr":"rum"}]}],[{"text":"ஊரோ","tr":"ūrō","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"ஊ","tr":"ū"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரோ","tr":"rō"}]},{"text":"நன்றுமன்","tr":"naṉṟumaṉ","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நன்","tr":"naṉ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"றுமன்","tr":"ṟumaṉ"}]},{"text":"மரந்தை","tr":"marantai","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மரந்","tr":"maran"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தை","tr":"tai"}]}],[{"text":"ஒருதனி","tr":"orutaṉi","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"ஒரு","tr":"oru"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"தனி","tr":"taṉi"}]},{"text":"வைகிற்","tr":"vaikiṟ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வை","tr":"vai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கிற்","tr":"kiṟ"}]},{"text":"புலம்பா","tr":"pulampā","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"புலம்","tr":"pulam"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"பா","tr":"pā"}]},{"text":"கின்றே","tr":"kiṉṟē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கின்","tr":"kiṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றே","tr":"ṟē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"தண்","parts":[{"text":"தண்","lemma":"தண்","gloss":"cool"}],"gloss":"cool"},{"surface":"கடல்","parts":[{"text":"கடல்","lemma":"கடல்","gloss":"sea"}],"gloss":"sea"},{"surface":"படு","parts":[{"text":"படு","lemma":"படு","gloss":"rising"}],"gloss":"rising"},{"surface":"திரை","parts":[{"text":"திரை","lemma":"திரை","gloss":"wave"}],"gloss":"wave"},{"surface":"பெயர்த்தலின்","parts":[{"text":"பெயர்த்தல்","lemma":"பெயர்த்தல்","gloss":"displacing"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"because of"}],"gloss":"because of displacing"},{"surface":"வெண்","parts":[{"text":"வெண்","lemma":"வெண்","gloss":"white"}],"gloss":"white","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"பறை","parts":[{"text":"பறை","lemma":"பறை","gloss":"wing"}],"gloss":"winged"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நாரை","parts":[{"text":"நாரை","lemma":"நாரை","gloss":"stork"}],"gloss":"stork"},{"surface":"நிரை","parts":[{"text":"நிரை","lemma":"நிரை","gloss":"row"}],"gloss":"row"},{"surface":"பெயர்ந்து","parts":[{"text":"பெயர்ந்து","lemma":"பெயர்ந்து","gloss":"having moved"}],"gloss":"having moved","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"அயிரை","parts":[{"text":"அயிரை","lemma":"அயிரை","gloss":"ayirai fish"}],"gloss":"ayirai fish"},{"surface":"ஆரும்","parts":[{"text":"ஆர்","lemma":"ஆர்தல்","gloss":"eat"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"relative participle"}],"gloss":"eating"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஊரோ","parts":[{"text":"ஊர்","lemma":"ஊர்","gloss":"town"},{"text":"ஓ","lemma":"ஓ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"the town indeed"},{"surface":"நன்று","parts":[{"text":"நன்று","lemma":"நன்று","gloss":"good"}],"gloss":"is good"},{"surface":"மன்","parts":[{"text":"மன்","lemma":"மன்","gloss":"particle of regret"}],"gloss":"indeed"},{"surface":"மரந்தை","parts":[{"text":"மரந்தை","lemma":"மரந்தை","gloss":"Marantai town"}],"gloss":"Marantai"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஒரு","parts":[{"text":"ஒரு","lemma":"ஒரு","gloss":"one"}],"gloss":"one"},{"surface":"தனி","parts":[{"text":"தனி","lemma":"தனி","gloss":"lonely"}],"gloss":"lonely"},{"surface":"வைகின்","parts":[{"text":"வைகு","lemma":"வைகுதல்","gloss":"stay"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"if"}],"gloss":"if staying"},{"surface":"புலம்பு","parts":[{"text":"புலம்பு","lemma":"புலம்பு","gloss":"loneliness"}],"gloss":"loneliness"},{"surface":"ஆகின்றே","parts":[{"text":"ஆகு","lemma":"ஆகுதல்","gloss":"become"},{"text":"இன்று","lemma":"இன்று","gloss":"present tense"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"becomes indeed"}]}],"literal":"Cool sea's rising wave because of displacing, white-winged / storks in a row having moved, ayirai fish eating. / The town indeed is good, Maranthai, / if in single loneliness one stays, it becomes lonely indeed.","translation":"Because the rising waves of the cool sea displace them, the white-winged storks move in rows to feed on ayirai fish. The town of Maranthai is indeed beautiful; yet, when one stays there all alone, it becomes a place of deep loneliness.","modern":"குளிர்ந்த கடலின் கரையை மோதும் அலைகள் கலைப்பதால், வெண்மையான இறக்கைகளை உடைய நாரைகள் வரிசையாக இடம் பெயர்ந்து சென்று அயிரை மீன்களை உண்ணும். மரந்தை என்னும் கடற்கரை ஊர் மிகவும் நல்ல ஊர்தான். ஆனால், தலைவனைப் பிரிந்து தனியாக அங்கு தங்கியிருக்கும்போது, அது மிகுந்த தனிமைத் துயரத்தைத் தருவதாக மாறுகிறது.","explanation":"In this Neytal poem, the companion (tōḻi) speaks to the hero about the heroine's suffering during his absence. She describes the coastal town of Maranthai, where white-winged storks are forced to move in rows to feed on ayirai fish because the rising waves of the cool sea displace them. While Maranthai is normally a beautiful and pleasant town, the companion points out that staying there alone makes it a place of intense loneliness. The image of storks being unsettled by the waves mirrors the heroine's mind, which is disturbed and displaced by her longing for the hero. Key words like 'taṇ kaṭal' (cool sea), 'nārai' (stork), and 'pulampu' (loneliness) emphasize the theme of separation and waiting characteristic of the coastal landscape.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,0.9],[0.9,1.7],[1.7,2.1],[2.1,2.35],[2.35,3.08],[3.08,3.45],[3.45,3.6],[3.6,5.1],[5.1,5.4],[5.4,5.7],[5.7,7.1],[7.1,7.37],[7.43,7.77],[7.91,8.13]],"female":[[0.0,0.8],[0.8,1.0],[1.0,1.7],[1.7,1.87],[1.87,2.27],[2.27,3.49],[3.49,4.09],[4.09,4.7],[4.7,5.4],[5.4,5.6],[5.6,6.0],[6.0,7.5],[7.5,7.93],[7.93,8.3],[8.3,8.58]]},"sync":[[["தண்","cool"],["கடல்","sea"]],[["படு","rising"],["திரை","wave"]],[["பெயர்த்தலின்","because of displacing"]],[["வெண்","white"],["பறை","winged"]],[["நாரை","stork"]],[["நிரை","row"],["பெயர்ந்து","having moved"]],[["பெயர்ந்து","having moved"],["அயிரை","ayirai fish"]],[["ஆரும்","eating"]],[["ஊரோ","the town indeed"]],[["நன்று","is good"],["மன்","indeed"]],[["மரந்தை","Marantai"]],[["ஒரு","one"],["தனி","lonely"]],[["வைகின்","if staying"]],[["புலம்பு","loneliness"]],[["ஆகின்றே","becomes indeed"]]]}